{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","群魔之眼"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","諸魔の瞳"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","拉曼提斯指挥使徒控制敌人，随后对所有敌人造成高额伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","選択した敵にスタンを付与し、敵全体に大ダメージを与える"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","拉曼提斯的每名使徒各选择一名敌人，眩晕目标使其无法行动，持续3.5秒，优先选择最靠前的不同敌人。随后拉曼提斯对所有敌人造成600% + 60% ATK伤害，同时使徒对被牵制的敌人施加等同于拉曼提斯20%初始生命上限的生命削减。该技能释放结束后，拉曼提斯和使徒在接下来10秒内提高60点攻击速度。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","使徒の数と同数の異なる敵にそれぞれ3.5秒間のスタンを付与。優先的に最も前にいる敵を対象にする。その後、ラメンティスが敵全体に600% + 60% ATKのダメージを与え、使徒がスタン対象の敵に、「ラメンティスの初期HP上限×20%」分のHP上限減少効果を与える。さらに、10秒間ラメンティスと使徒の攻撃速度+60"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":65,"end":71,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":67,"end":73,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":61,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":108,"end":112,"tooltip_key":"keyword:hpCut"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":63,"end":77,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":119,"end":125,"tooltip_key":"keyword:hpCut"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害量提高至640% + 60% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが640% + 60% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害量提高至680% + 60% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが680% + 60% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/descripti